## Installation

**1. Put the binary on your PATH.** Once compiled, move MACRO_INLINE_CODE _tec MACRO_INLINE_CODE into one of the
directories listed in MACRO_INLINE_CODE PATH MACRO_INLINE_CODE — MACRO_INLINE_CODE ~/.local/bin MACRO_INLINE_CODE is a good spot.

**2. Add the shell wrapper** to your shell rc file, be it MACRO_INLINE_CODE ~/.bashrc MACRO_INLINE_CODE ,
MACRO_INLINE_CODE ~/.zshrc MACRO_INLINE_CODE or another one. It is what lets Tec change the directory of
the shell you are sitting in.

MACRO_CODE bash
include(shell/tec.sh)dnl
MACRO_CODE

**3. Create a config file**, either at MACRO_INLINE_CODE ~/.tec/tec.cfg MACRO_INLINE_CODE or at
MACRO_INLINE_CODE ~/.config/tec/tec.cfg MACRO_INLINE_CODE , and fill it with the content below.

MACRO_CODE
include(shell/tec.cfg)dnl
MACRO_CODE

